WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 19=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.680 --> 01:44.639
Liang Yu, Commander
of the Shence Garrison,

01:45.120 --> 01:46.960
has enjoyed His Majesty's favor,

01:47.400 --> 01:49.399
yet has given no thought
to serving the realm.

01:49.400 --> 01:51.279
He colluded with Dai Rong

01:51.400 --> 01:53.479
and formed a faction for personal gain.

01:53.799 --> 01:55.279
He disregarded the greater good

01:55.280 --> 01:57.080
and pursued his own interests.

01:57.599 --> 02:01.800
He is hereby stripped
of office and imprisoned,

02:02.159 --> 02:04.080
pending further judgment.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.560
- He's coming out!
- He's coming out!

02:22.319 --> 02:23.158
What a disgrace!

02:23.159 --> 02:24.280
Lin Jinqi,

02:24.840 --> 02:26.158
I had no grudge against you,

02:26.159 --> 02:27.560
yet you kept coming after me

02:27.639 --> 02:28.679
and wouldn't let up.

02:28.680 --> 02:30.079
You old scoundrel!

02:30.080 --> 02:32.120
How dare you accuse others
of your own crimes!

02:39.199 --> 02:40.639
This pile of horse manure is

02:40.719 --> 02:42.100
for our brothers who died unjustly.

02:42.110 --> 02:44.440
You heartless beast!
Even horse manure is cleaner than you!

02:44.456 --> 02:46.950
- Beat him to death!
- Beat him to death!

02:51.879 --> 02:53.399
That's enough!

02:53.400 --> 02:55.160
Make way!

02:59.560 --> 03:00.680
Everyone, move aside.

03:00.728 --> 03:03.288
Don't interfere with
Judicial Officer Yang's official duties.

03:19.159 --> 03:20.119
Today,

03:20.120 --> 03:21.660
I must return to report on my mission,

03:21.672 --> 03:22.840
so I can't stay long.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.119
Next time,

03:24.120 --> 03:25.639
we'll have a proper gathering.

03:38.456 --> 03:40.720
This time, it was thanks
to Assistant Commander Lin

03:41.080 --> 03:43.039
that the truth finally came to light.

03:43.560 --> 03:45.039
Our fallen brothers

03:45.240 --> 03:47.000
can finally rest in peace.

03:48.080 --> 03:49.320
I can't take the credit.

03:50.759 --> 03:52.120
From capturing the Wo pirates

03:52.479 --> 03:53.799
and arresting Dai Rong

03:53.919 --> 03:55.280
to exposing Liang Yu,

03:55.304 --> 03:56.552
every one of you played a part.

03:56.648 --> 03:58.070
I've reported everything truthfully.

03:58.088 --> 03:59.850
When the rewards
are given for your service,

03:59.860 --> 04:01.250
every one of you will get your due!

04:01.260 --> 04:03.359
- Good!
- Good!

04:03.360 --> 04:06.799
- Good!
- Good!

04:06.800 --> 04:09.000
- Good!
- Good!

04:25.520 --> 04:27.720
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

04:27.720 --> 04:29.560
Tongcao, Baogai.

04:30.168 --> 04:32.120
Luckily, you two brought it
to our attention,

04:32.399 --> 04:34.679
allowing Lanxiang
to discover that Du Cuique

04:34.680 --> 04:37.240
had ordered Lingdang
to poison the bathwater.

04:37.879 --> 04:39.519
This is your reward.

04:44.712 --> 04:47.464
- Thanks for the reward, First Madam.
- Thanks for the reward, First Madam.

04:49.399 --> 04:50.519
Gantang.

04:53.120 --> 04:54.638
Your mother has been by my side

04:54.639 --> 04:56.199
and served me for several years.

04:56.519 --> 04:59.480
I find you even
more capable than your mother.

05:00.000 --> 05:01.278
Keep up the good work.

05:01.279 --> 05:03.279
The Lin Residence will treat you well.

05:03.336 --> 05:04.950
Thank you for the reward,
First Madam.

05:15.279 --> 05:16.399
Lanxiang.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.638
This time,

05:22.639 --> 05:24.959
you practically saved everyone
in the Lin Residence.

05:25.040 --> 05:26.599
That's no small achievement.

05:26.800 --> 05:28.120
Besides gold and silver,

05:28.480 --> 05:30.320
is there anything else you want?

05:38.000 --> 05:40.959
You've always been open and forthright.

05:41.120 --> 05:44.199
Whatever you want,
don't hesitate to ask.

05:58.079 --> 05:59.119
First Madam.

05:59.120 --> 06:00.438
I humbly ask

06:00.439 --> 06:02.000
that you grant me

06:02.199 --> 06:04.480
the indentures of all three members

06:04.639 --> 06:05.920
of my family.

06:21.120 --> 06:22.959
You want to become free commoners?

06:23.800 --> 06:25.800
I beg you to grant
my request, First Madam.

06:29.256 --> 06:31.384
Why do you suddenly want
to buy your family's freedom

06:31.432 --> 06:32.750
and leave?

06:33.279 --> 06:34.679
Was your father

06:34.680 --> 06:36.040
mistreated at the shop,

06:36.360 --> 06:38.639
or have you been
treated harshly in the residence?

06:39.600 --> 06:41.599
My father hasn't been mistreated at all,

06:41.600 --> 06:43.719
nor have I been treated
harshly in any way.

06:43.720 --> 06:45.352
Our masters have been generous and kind.

06:45.384 --> 06:47.150
Our whole family is truly fortunate.

06:48.920 --> 06:49.920
It's just that

06:50.079 --> 06:52.040
I've been frail since childhood.

06:52.160 --> 06:53.680
To pay for my treatment,

06:53.720 --> 06:55.559
my parents scrimped and saved

06:55.560 --> 06:57.800
and never had a single day of comfort.

06:57.879 --> 06:59.878
Now that they're getting old,

06:59.879 --> 07:03.800
I only want to stay
by their side and care for them.

07:03.992 --> 07:05.576
I don't want the day to come

07:05.580 --> 07:07.830
when I wish to care for them,
but they're no longer here.

07:11.879 --> 07:13.599
Your devotion
to your parents is admirable,

07:14.319 --> 07:16.159
and what you say makes sense.

07:18.720 --> 07:21.759
But you currently serve at Zhichun Hall.

07:21.879 --> 07:23.000
As for this,

07:23.920 --> 07:26.240
we should still ask
Young Master what he thinks.

07:27.080 --> 07:29.470
Thank you for your kindness
and understanding, First Madam,

07:29.480 --> 07:30.680
and for not holding

07:30.920 --> 07:32.399
this personal wish of mine against me.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.719
You heartless girl.

07:58.759 --> 08:00.199
You're ready to leave just like that,

08:00.279 --> 08:02.040
without a thought for us.

08:03.680 --> 08:05.159
Who says I'm leaving just like that?

08:05.160 --> 08:06.920
First Madam hasn't agreed yet.

08:07.279 --> 08:09.359
You've done
such a great service this time.

08:09.360 --> 08:11.040
First Madam is sure to agree.

08:14.199 --> 08:15.398
We shouldn't presume

08:15.399 --> 08:17.480
to know what our masters are thinking,

08:17.720 --> 08:19.360
or we'll only get our hopes up.

08:38.679 --> 08:40.319
Ever since we returned to Zhichun Hall,

08:40.320 --> 08:42.199
you've been so downhearted.

08:42.480 --> 08:45.040
Where did that cheerful,
talkative Xiaolian go?

08:45.120 --> 08:46.040
That's right.

08:46.320 --> 08:49.040
Where did the old Xiaolian go?

08:53.840 --> 08:54.839
Aren't you

08:57.080 --> 08:58.800
angry with me?

09:01.360 --> 09:03.680
The first time Lingdang
went to the tea room,

09:03.840 --> 09:05.680
I was the one who showed her there.

09:06.600 --> 09:09.040
I must have been completely blind,

09:09.080 --> 09:10.879
mistaking a bad person for a good one.

09:11.256 --> 09:12.630
Who knows how many things I said

09:12.639 --> 09:14.439
that I shouldn't have

09:14.440 --> 09:16.560
or how many things I did
that I shouldn't have.

09:18.759 --> 09:20.999
Are you afraid
First Madam will punish you?

09:23.879 --> 09:26.400
If I did something wrong,
I should be punished.

09:26.919 --> 09:28.999
I just feel so foolish.

09:29.000 --> 09:29.719
I almost caused...

09:29.720 --> 09:31.119
By that reasoning,

09:31.120 --> 09:34.239
Young Master and First Madam
are the most at fault, then.

09:35.448 --> 09:37.310
Young Master brought
Du Zheng and his sister

09:37.320 --> 09:38.719
back from Jinzhou,

09:38.720 --> 09:41.032
and First Madam arranged
for them to enter the residence.

09:41.799 --> 09:43.119
That's not the same.

09:43.120 --> 09:46.158
Young Master and First Madam
were deceived because of their kindness.

09:46.159 --> 09:47.479
Weren't you the same?

09:48.200 --> 09:49.320
Exactly.

09:49.559 --> 09:51.278
You were deceived

09:51.279 --> 09:52.999
because you were too kindhearted.

09:54.399 --> 09:55.758
It's all in the past now.

09:55.759 --> 09:58.079
Don't keep blaming yourself.

09:59.679 --> 10:00.440
Then,

10:01.279 --> 10:03.440
by your reasoning,

10:05.320 --> 10:07.440
I did nothing wrong at all?

10:10.919 --> 10:12.879
Of course you did something wrong.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.518
Young Master and First Madam

10:15.519 --> 10:17.398
trusted Du Zheng and his sister because

10:17.399 --> 10:19.839
Du Zheng had once
saved Young Master's life.

10:19.919 --> 10:21.160
But you?

10:21.200 --> 10:23.558
You hardly knew Du Cuique at all,

10:23.559 --> 10:25.959
yet you plunged right in
without a second thought.

10:26.360 --> 10:27.558
As the old saying goes,

10:27.559 --> 10:29.079
never seek to harm others,

10:29.080 --> 10:31.280
but always guard against harm.

10:33.120 --> 10:35.239
You only followed the first half,

10:35.750 --> 10:37.512
but neglected the second.

10:37.672 --> 10:38.990
So naturally, one careless step

10:39.000 --> 10:40.520
was enough to make you stumble.

10:41.720 --> 10:46.999
Never seek to harm others,

10:48.000 --> 10:53.798
but always guard against harm.

10:53.799 --> 10:55.560
Then stop feeling bad.

10:55.720 --> 10:57.959
Now that the three of us
have come into some money,

10:57.960 --> 11:00.119
you'd better sweet-talk us

11:00.120 --> 11:02.119
and keep us three wealthy ladies happy.

11:02.120 --> 11:04.280
There'll be plenty in it for you.

11:25.440 --> 11:27.079
These are gifts for you.

11:27.279 --> 11:28.400
Gifts?

11:29.510 --> 11:31.650
Gantang said before
that she wanted to learn to read,

11:31.660 --> 11:32.918
so I asked Jiugao to buy a beginner's

11:32.920 --> 11:35.320
(Three Character Classic)
copy of the Three Character Classic.

11:35.336 --> 11:37.070
The Three Character Classic?

11:46.279 --> 11:47.959
It smells of fresh ink.

11:53.200 --> 11:55.199
What good is giving us books?

11:55.799 --> 11:57.440
You're about to leave the residence.

11:57.480 --> 11:58.879
There'll be no one to teach us.

11:59.200 --> 12:00.119
Can these words

12:00.399 --> 12:02.800
tell us how to read them on their own?

12:05.080 --> 12:07.079
I've already spoken to Yuchan.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.558
As long as you're willing to learn,

12:08.559 --> 12:10.479
Yuchan will teach you.

12:10.759 --> 12:11.879
Really?

12:14.559 --> 12:16.280
Will Yuchan really agree?

12:17.039 --> 12:18.160
Back then,

12:18.799 --> 12:20.119
I learned to read from the maid

12:20.120 --> 12:22.160
who kept the account books
for First Madam.

12:22.720 --> 12:23.638
Now,

12:23.639 --> 12:25.680
as long as you're
sincere about learning,

12:25.799 --> 12:27.400
I'll gladly teach you.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.640
I truly want to learn.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.839
- So do I.
- So do I.

12:35.480 --> 12:38.239
I'll take you three
on as my students for now.

12:38.399 --> 12:40.999
But how much you learn

12:41.000 --> 12:43.119
will depend on each of you.

12:49.679 --> 12:51.320
You're the one who started all this,

12:51.559 --> 12:54.320
and now you're the one backing out.

12:56.159 --> 12:57.278
First Madam hasn't agreed

12:57.279 --> 12:58.560
to let me leave yet.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.239
Young Master went to Rongzhang House.

13:01.320 --> 13:03.839
I imagine he's there
to discuss your request.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.440
Once Young Master returns,

13:05.480 --> 13:06.999
we'll know the answer.

13:17.039 --> 13:18.800
After Lanxiang
distinguished herself before,

13:19.039 --> 13:20.599
she never asked for a reward.

13:21.320 --> 13:23.239
So she was saving up her merits

13:23.440 --> 13:24.719
to ask for her indenture.

13:27.600 --> 13:30.439
Lanxiang is clever and capable,

13:30.440 --> 13:32.359
and you're relying
on her heavily right now.

13:32.600 --> 13:35.359
I thought you
wouldn't want to let her go.

13:41.480 --> 13:42.959
Lanxiang is capable,

13:43.200 --> 13:46.038
but Yuchan and Gantang
are just as capable.

13:46.040 --> 13:47.752
It's not as though
we can't do without her.

13:54.840 --> 13:56.400
As for Du Zheng and his sister,

13:56.639 --> 13:58.400
the Lin Residence
has a clear conscience.

13:58.919 --> 14:00.798
But outsiders
don't know the whole story,

14:00.799 --> 14:02.560
so some criticism is inevitable.

14:03.304 --> 14:05.550
By granting Lanxiang
and her family their freedom now,

14:05.559 --> 14:07.320
we can set an example
within the residence

14:07.399 --> 14:10.278
and show the servants
that as long as they serve faithfully,

14:10.280 --> 14:12.184
their masters
will never treat them unfairly.

14:12.480 --> 14:14.839
It will also silence those outside
who seek to make trouble

14:14.840 --> 14:16.079
and show them

14:16.240 --> 14:17.359
that in the Lin Residence,

14:17.360 --> 14:19.638
whether master or servant,

14:19.639 --> 14:21.040
we value loyalty and honor.

14:21.720 --> 14:24.040
We were thinking the same thing.

14:24.480 --> 14:25.520
Then this matter

14:25.759 --> 14:27.040
is settled.

14:30.039 --> 14:33.359
Give the indentures for Lanxiang
and her parents to Young Master.

14:46.279 --> 14:47.440
I'll take my leave.

14:57.759 --> 14:59.959
Lanxiang is clever and capable.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.400
I really am reluctant to let her go.

15:03.879 --> 15:06.640
But Zhichun Hall
really can't keep her either.

15:07.679 --> 15:09.518
What madam of the household

15:09.519 --> 15:11.239
could tolerate having her husband

15:11.240 --> 15:12.959
keep such
an outstanding maid by his side?

15:13.320 --> 15:16.918
I originally planned to wait until
the inner residence was put in order

15:16.920 --> 15:19.310
and the mess left by Du Zheng
and his sister was dealt with,

15:19.320 --> 15:21.038
then before Young Master's engagement,

15:21.039 --> 15:23.599
find Lanxiang another place to go.

15:25.039 --> 15:26.520
But now,

15:26.720 --> 15:28.160
it seems I worried for nothing.

15:28.919 --> 15:30.680
A girl as clever as she is

15:30.919 --> 15:33.839
would naturally plan her own future.

15:34.639 --> 15:36.920
This is for the best.

15:37.159 --> 15:39.599
It brings our bond as madam
and servant to a fitting end.

15:45.360 --> 15:48.479
Young Master is my own son,

15:48.799 --> 15:51.680
yet now even I can't understand him.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.999
How did he agree so readily?

15:55.879 --> 15:59.280
I thought this would
take some persuading.

16:02.600 --> 16:05.758
Young Master isn't like Master.

16:05.759 --> 16:07.719
He doesn't mistake
womanizing for refinement.

16:09.279 --> 16:11.520
Zhao Xingtang has done
so many outrageous things,

16:11.799 --> 16:14.320
yet Young Master has never
once suggested taking a concubine.

16:15.000 --> 16:17.680
That shows how devoted he is.

16:18.159 --> 16:19.479
Just like you, First Madam.

16:22.039 --> 16:24.959
Amaranth in the seventh month
is worth its weight in gold!

16:24.960 --> 16:27.239
(Glorify the Family Name)

16:27.240 --> 16:28.239
Keeping busy?

16:31.960 --> 16:35.119
Amaranth!

16:46.620 --> 16:49.380
(Indentures)

16:54.600 --> 16:56.599
These are the indentures
for your family.

17:01.016 --> 17:03.640
And this is the deed of emancipation
I've signed and sealed.

17:10.740 --> 17:12.100
(Party to the Agreement: Lin Jinqi)

17:12.120 --> 17:13.250
(Deed of Emancipation)

17:13.260 --> 17:14.088
(Party to the Agreement: Lin Jinqi)

17:14.504 --> 17:15.830
Take a look.

17:16.279 --> 17:17.679
If everything is in order,

17:17.688 --> 17:19.590
Jiugao will accompany you
to the authorities

17:19.590 --> 17:21.210
to complete
the emancipation formalities.

17:21.220 --> 17:22.960
With the Lin Residence
acting as guarantor,

17:23.000 --> 17:24.890
you'll be registered
with a nearby neighborhood.

17:26.280 --> 17:28.070
Thank you for your kindness,
Young Master.

17:28.079 --> 17:29.318
Quickly, thank him.

17:29.319 --> 17:31.239
- Thank you for your kindness, Young Master.
- Thank you for your kindness, Young Master.

17:31.240 --> 17:32.959
Thank you for your kindness,
Young Master.

17:32.960 --> 17:34.648
Thank you for your kindness,
Young Master.

17:56.119 --> 17:58.359
You're no longer servants
of the Lin Residence.

17:58.799 --> 17:59.720
From now on,

17:59.960 --> 18:01.879
you needn't kneel and bow to me anymore.

18:03.039 --> 18:04.119
This...

18:14.056 --> 18:15.550
You're most gracious, Young Master.

18:15.559 --> 18:17.720
Our family can never thank you enough.

18:17.896 --> 18:20.888
- You're most gracious, Young Master.
- You're most gracious, Young Master.

18:37.000 --> 18:37.278
This...

18:37.279 --> 18:39.119
First Madam gave you 150 taels,

18:39.319 --> 18:41.200
and Young Master gave you 100 taels.

18:41.279 --> 18:42.919
That's 250 taels of silver in total.

18:43.519 --> 18:46.078
First Madam said it's difficult
to find a home in Jinling City.

18:46.079 --> 18:48.040
She said not to rush
and to take your time.

18:48.136 --> 18:49.400
Until you find a suitable place,

18:49.448 --> 18:51.150
you may continue living where you are.

18:51.319 --> 18:52.798
Once everything is settled,

18:52.799 --> 18:54.480
choose an auspicious day to move.

18:56.279 --> 18:57.639
First Madam also said

18:57.640 --> 19:01.040
your family
should live well from now on.

19:01.144 --> 19:02.470
If you ever run into difficulties,

19:02.480 --> 19:03.560
just come to us.

19:04.640 --> 19:06.240
You were once part of the Lin household.

19:06.359 --> 19:07.919
No matter where you go in the future,

19:08.599 --> 19:11.399
the bond between us
will remain unchanged.

19:12.680 --> 19:13.480
This...

19:17.160 --> 19:17.879
This...

19:18.240 --> 19:21.199
Thank you, Young Master and
First Madam, for your great kindness.

19:21.200 --> 19:21.879
This...

19:23.039 --> 19:25.119
We don't know
how we could ever repay you.

19:26.600 --> 19:28.790
First Madam, Young Master,
for all you've done for us,

19:28.799 --> 19:31.199
our whole family will always
remember your kindness.

19:31.200 --> 19:32.919
Every day,
we'll kowtow to the Bodhisattva

19:33.192 --> 19:34.870
and pray
for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

19:34.960 --> 19:36.590
May First Madam
be blessed with many descendants

19:36.600 --> 19:37.990
and an ever-flourishing family line.

19:38.000 --> 19:39.950
May Young Master
be blessed with a destined match

19:39.960 --> 19:41.359
and a marriage made in heaven.

19:44.680 --> 19:45.480
Yes.

19:45.510 --> 19:47.864
Every day, we'll kowtow
and burn incense to the Bodhisattva

19:47.880 --> 19:48.990
and pray
for the Bodhisattva's blessings.

19:49.000 --> 19:49.598
May...

19:49.599 --> 19:51.320
May the Bodhisattva bless you.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.439
You certainly have a way with words.

19:54.880 --> 19:56.079
What you said

19:56.200 --> 19:58.119
is exactly
what First Madam and I wish for.

19:58.696 --> 20:00.310
May your auspicious words come true.

20:00.319 --> 20:01.560
I hope that someday,

20:01.680 --> 20:03.560
everything will turn out
just as we wish.

20:08.920 --> 20:11.399
Jiugao, before the government office
closes for the day,

20:11.400 --> 20:12.798
take Uncle Xu and his family there

20:12.799 --> 20:14.140
and get their things done at once.

20:14.200 --> 20:14.879
Yes.

20:15.599 --> 20:16.760
Uncle Xu, Aunt Xu.

20:16.920 --> 20:17.800
Let's go.

20:18.680 --> 20:20.552
- We're leaving, Young Master.
- We're leaving.

20:20.600 --> 20:26.820
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

20:27.180 --> 20:32.980
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

20:39.599 --> 20:41.159
She certainly looks happy.

20:42.480 --> 20:44.078
Not the least bit reluctant to leave.

20:44.079 --> 20:49.299
♪Half a lifetime
of longing returns to this moment♪

20:49.300 --> 20:56.900
♪Love and guilt intertwine,
what if the reflection isn't real?♪

20:57.460 --> 21:03.020
♪I still remember your name♪

21:04.620 --> 21:11.900
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

21:12.220 --> 21:19.700
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

21:19.780 --> 21:27.140
♪No longer let the world's wind and snow fall,
leaving the grass and trees covered in frost♪

21:27.660 --> 21:31.259
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

21:31.260 --> 21:36.020
♪You and I will walk there together♪

21:47.799 --> 21:49.919
So it's a bride leaving for her wedding.

21:49.960 --> 21:51.720
No wonder the drums
and music are so loud.

21:57.920 --> 21:59.560
Do you know who the bride is?

22:01.839 --> 22:03.760
Grand Secretary Zhao's
eldest granddaughter,

22:04.559 --> 22:05.800
Young Lady Zhao,

22:06.744 --> 22:08.560
is marrying
into a family in the capital.

22:35.079 --> 22:36.879
Father, Mother.

22:36.920 --> 22:37.518
Let's go.

22:37.520 --> 22:39.270
Let's get our
household registration papers.

22:39.280 --> 22:40.720
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

22:46.039 --> 22:47.159
Will we make it in time?

22:47.160 --> 22:48.239
We will.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.256
Will we make it in time?

22:49.288 --> 22:50.800
We will.

23:36.940 --> 23:40.798
(Tomb of Du Zheng
of the Jinzhou Government Office)

23:40.799 --> 23:41.919
Congyi.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.720
Your sister

23:47.160 --> 23:49.000
acted on Dai Rong's orders

23:49.759 --> 23:51.200
and poisoned the Lin Residence

23:52.359 --> 23:54.000
in an attempt to kill me.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.839
She failed

23:59.000 --> 24:01.560
and instead caused
the death of her own maid.

24:03.839 --> 24:04.919
According to the law,

24:06.440 --> 24:08.320
she was sentenced to exile 1,500 km away

24:09.319 --> 24:10.919
and banished to Qiongzhou,

24:12.759 --> 24:14.079
never to return.

25:07.140 --> 25:15.900
(Tomb of Du Zheng
of the Jinzhou Government Office)

25:57.880 --> 25:59.520
Lin Jinqi.

26:04.599 --> 26:07.280
You brought my brother
and me into the Lin Residence.

26:08.480 --> 26:10.679
We seemed to live in comfort and luxury,

26:11.000 --> 26:12.679
without the slightest neglect.

26:14.359 --> 26:15.679
But in truth,

26:17.119 --> 26:19.320
you never really regarded us

26:20.599 --> 26:23.040
as your equals.

26:26.640 --> 26:28.839
If you had been willing
to take me as your concubine,

26:30.400 --> 26:32.639
I wouldn't have had
to seek Dai Rong's support,

26:34.440 --> 26:35.800
and my brother

26:37.480 --> 26:40.480
wouldn't be lying beneath the earth now.

27:24.319 --> 27:26.159
It wasn't I who looked down on you.

27:28.359 --> 27:31.000
You were the one
who looked down on yourself.

27:36.400 --> 27:39.000
If you truly believed
you were our equal,

27:39.599 --> 27:41.358
you should have aspired

27:41.359 --> 27:43.839
to marry properly and become a wife,

27:44.920 --> 27:47.200
rather than become someone's concubine.

27:59.319 --> 28:00.480
It's a long journey,

28:00.599 --> 28:01.720
so it's time to set off.

28:15.440 --> 28:16.200
Let's go.

28:41.880 --> 28:42.639
Go.

29:09.300 --> 29:10.840
(Reply Accepting the Marriage Proposal)

29:10.850 --> 29:12.390
Now that I have this letter of consent,

29:12.400 --> 29:14.078
I'll hurry back to
the Marquis's Residence with the answer.

29:14.079 --> 29:15.399
Old Madam Yuan is still at home,

29:15.400 --> 29:16.798
waiting for the good news.

29:16.799 --> 29:18.159
Thank you for your trouble.

29:18.640 --> 29:20.200
His Lordship is no longer young.

29:20.240 --> 29:21.100
Old Madam Yuan's wish

29:21.110 --> 29:22.679
is to choose the nearest auspicious date

29:22.680 --> 29:23.598
and present the betrothal gifts.

29:23.599 --> 29:25.960
The betrothal gifts
are already prepared.

29:26.039 --> 29:27.639
Good.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.070
No need to see me out, Madam.

29:29.079 --> 29:29.598
Please stay.

29:29.599 --> 29:30.560
Madam Li.

29:38.440 --> 29:40.320
This is wonderful.

29:40.472 --> 29:41.750
From what the matchmaker said,

29:41.759 --> 29:44.159
Old Madam Yuan
thinks very highly of this marriage.

29:44.720 --> 29:46.560
The betrothal gifts are generous.

29:47.400 --> 29:49.639
I think we should add
a little more to Xiuwan's dowry.

29:49.640 --> 29:50.800
Add more.

29:52.000 --> 29:53.599
What else should we add?

29:56.079 --> 29:56.999
Oh, my dear girl.

29:57.000 --> 29:58.639
What's gotten into you now?

30:01.079 --> 30:02.000
You...

30:02.079 --> 30:02.879
I...

30:03.200 --> 30:03.960
You...

30:12.279 --> 30:13.479
Dressed like this...

30:13.480 --> 30:14.159
You...

30:14.839 --> 30:17.280
Du Zheng and I had already
pledged ourselves to each other.

30:17.319 --> 30:18.479
Now that he's dead,

30:18.480 --> 30:20.560
of course I must mourn for him.

30:21.799 --> 30:23.599
Oh, Xiuwan.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.119
Listen to me.

30:29.000 --> 30:31.760
Du Zheng is already dead.

30:31.800 --> 30:33.670
Let's just pretend
none of this ever happened.

30:33.680 --> 30:35.000
Never happened.

30:35.279 --> 30:36.639
Hurry and forget all about them.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.358
Forget them.

30:37.359 --> 30:39.040
I can't.

30:39.759 --> 30:40.999
Du Zheng wanted to

30:41.000 --> 30:43.439
earn a quick promotion for my sake,
and that led him astray.

30:43.759 --> 30:45.480
He lost his life because of me.

30:45.680 --> 30:47.720
I'll never forget him
for as long as I live.

30:49.960 --> 30:51.358
Take these clothes off first.

30:51.359 --> 30:52.518
Take them off!

30:52.519 --> 30:53.919
- Take them off!
- I won't!

30:53.920 --> 30:55.520
Take them off!

30:57.200 --> 30:58.320
Madam.

31:09.960 --> 31:11.399
I won't.

31:11.960 --> 31:13.599
I won't!

31:16.680 --> 31:18.239
How did I end up with a daughter

31:18.240 --> 31:20.800
so utterly obsessed?

31:21.880 --> 31:22.639
Take them off!

31:22.640 --> 31:23.318
No!

31:23.319 --> 31:24.318
- Take them off!
- No!

31:24.319 --> 31:25.078
Take them off!

31:25.079 --> 31:26.199
No!

31:26.200 --> 31:27.439
Take them off!

31:29.039 --> 31:29.800
You...

31:34.400 --> 31:35.199
Shunhua.

31:35.200 --> 31:36.159
Quickly.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.919
Please talk some sense into Xiuwan.

31:38.279 --> 31:41.439
She's going to be the death of me!

31:44.359 --> 31:46.038
As her elders,

31:46.039 --> 31:48.000
we should conduct ourselves accordingly.

31:50.359 --> 31:51.200
I...

31:55.079 --> 31:56.079
Xiuwan.

31:56.440 --> 31:57.639
These past few days,

31:57.640 --> 32:00.358
I've been investigating
everything Du Cuique did.

32:00.359 --> 32:02.359
Some of it concerns you,

32:02.480 --> 32:04.079
so you ought to know.

32:04.559 --> 32:06.480
Whatever Du Cuique may have done,

32:06.519 --> 32:08.359
it had nothing to do with Zheng.

32:08.720 --> 32:10.919
Zheng saved Jinqi's life.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.599
He was the Lin family's lifesaver.

32:14.480 --> 32:15.919
Bring her in.

32:21.220 --> 32:24.540
(Zhou Ci'er, Lin Xiuwan's wet nurse)

32:25.519 --> 32:26.798
Madam Zhou.

32:26.800 --> 32:28.616
For the sake of having
nursed and raised you,

32:28.648 --> 32:31.350
please save me.

32:31.359 --> 32:34.159
During the banquet
on the Festival of Man,

32:34.519 --> 32:36.960
Du Cuique bribed Madam Zhou

32:37.200 --> 32:38.318
and had her son Shitou

32:38.319 --> 32:41.040
deliberately wet Xie Zhao's clothes,

32:41.640 --> 32:42.598
forcing Xie Zhao

32:42.599 --> 32:45.000
to change out of the dark teal robe
he had been wearing.

32:45.240 --> 32:46.679
She also instructed Yinxian

32:46.720 --> 32:48.320
to pass information to you,

32:48.640 --> 32:50.720
misleading you
into believing that Du Zheng

32:50.839 --> 32:52.439
was Xie Zhao.

32:56.440 --> 32:58.679
Is that true?

33:00.079 --> 33:02.679
Is what First Madam said true?

33:02.839 --> 33:04.358
I was blinded by greed.

33:04.359 --> 33:06.119
I was foolish in my old age.

33:06.160 --> 33:07.879
Please forgive me this once.

33:07.880 --> 33:09.439
I'll never do it again.

33:09.440 --> 33:11.079
Never again.

33:11.400 --> 33:12.439
Madam Zhou.

33:13.119 --> 33:14.560
What else did you do?

33:14.960 --> 33:16.320
When Du Cuique

33:17.759 --> 33:20.800
took Young Lady
to the temple to offer incense,

33:21.319 --> 33:23.399
she had me send Yinxian away

33:23.599 --> 33:27.040
so Du Zheng could approach Young Lady.

33:28.039 --> 33:31.480
I... I also told her
where Young Lady would be

33:31.519 --> 33:33.040
so Du Zheng

33:33.519 --> 33:35.480
could arrange to run into Young Lady.

33:55.319 --> 33:57.760
It... It was all a lie.

34:00.039 --> 34:03.000
It... It was all a lie.

34:07.599 --> 34:09.999
No... No, that's impossible.

34:10.000 --> 34:12.158
You old woman!

34:12.159 --> 34:15.519
I've always treated you well!

34:16.424 --> 34:17.430
I'll beat you to death,

34:17.440 --> 34:19.319
you treacherous wretch!

34:19.320 --> 34:20.439
You wretch!

34:20.440 --> 34:21.118
You wretch!

34:21.119 --> 34:23.600
You treacherous wretch!

34:23.920 --> 34:24.919
Don't hit me!

34:24.920 --> 34:25.919
Stop hitting me!

34:25.920 --> 34:26.959
I was wrong!

34:28.039 --> 34:30.759
I know I was wrong!

34:30.760 --> 34:31.999
I know I was wrong!

34:32.000 --> 34:34.279
You wretch!

34:34.280 --> 34:38.200
You wretch!

34:48.880 --> 34:51.559
My poor Xiuwan.

34:59.199 --> 35:04.118
May you die a wretched death!

35:04.119 --> 35:05.640
Mother.

35:10.760 --> 35:12.280
Mother.

35:17.239 --> 35:18.200
It's all right.

35:18.679 --> 35:19.640
It's all right.

35:20.199 --> 35:21.280
It's not your fault.

35:21.760 --> 35:22.919
It's not your fault.

35:24.440 --> 35:25.439
Let's just

35:25.720 --> 35:27.240
think of it as a terrible nightmare.

35:27.639 --> 35:28.999
Take these clothes off.

35:29.320 --> 35:30.518
Take them off and burn them.

35:30.519 --> 35:31.439
Burn them.

35:31.500 --> 35:33.430
We'll treat it
as nothing more than a nightmare.

35:33.440 --> 35:34.399
Now that you're awake,

35:34.400 --> 35:36.160
everything can go back
to the way it was.

35:40.199 --> 35:41.680
My dear Xiuwan.

35:41.760 --> 35:44.320
You're going to marry
into the Marquis's Residence.

35:47.360 --> 35:49.879
I've prepared a generous dowry for you.

35:50.960 --> 35:52.240
Once you're married,

35:53.679 --> 35:55.720
you'll be the Marchioness.

35:57.559 --> 35:58.519
Lingxiao.

35:59.559 --> 36:01.399
You need to think this through.

36:01.688 --> 36:03.270
If we deceive the Yuan family like this,

36:03.280 --> 36:04.240
what if...

36:05.320 --> 36:06.598
Instead of joining our families,

36:06.599 --> 36:08.200
we could make enemies of them.

36:08.400 --> 36:09.640
There is no what if.

36:10.559 --> 36:11.919
Absolutely not.

36:12.320 --> 36:13.959
These are all trusted servants.

36:14.880 --> 36:17.310
If you say nothing and I say nothing,
no one will ever know.

36:17.320 --> 36:18.640
No one will know.

36:19.920 --> 36:20.600
You...

36:20.960 --> 36:21.919
Shunhua.

36:23.239 --> 36:25.720
This isn't like what happened
with the Xie family.

36:26.039 --> 36:27.519
I've already accepted the match

36:27.528 --> 36:29.736
and received the Yuan family's
formal marriage proposal.

36:30.039 --> 36:31.600
If we back out now

36:31.760 --> 36:32.919
and word gets out,

36:33.079 --> 36:34.439
Xiuwan

36:34.679 --> 36:37.240
will never be able
to arrange another marriage.

36:38.840 --> 36:39.800
Shunhua.

36:40.039 --> 36:41.718
You and I are as close as sisters.

36:41.719 --> 36:44.080
Xiuwan is like your own daughter.

36:44.239 --> 36:46.479
Please help us.

36:46.616 --> 36:49.000
As long as you're willing
to help us keep this quiet,

36:49.239 --> 36:51.120
we can pretend none of it ever happened.

37:30.000 --> 37:31.120
Changmin.

37:31.639 --> 37:32.839
Yes, Father.

37:34.400 --> 37:36.760
Go to Marquis Yongchang's
Residence tomorrow

37:38.239 --> 37:40.959
and apologize to Old Madam Yuan.

37:41.800 --> 37:43.559
Call off this marriage.

37:43.760 --> 37:44.640
No!

37:46.280 --> 37:47.479
Absolutely not!

37:50.119 --> 37:51.240
Old Master.

37:51.559 --> 37:52.558
Everyone in Jinling City

37:52.559 --> 37:54.320
already knows that the Lin family

37:54.360 --> 37:56.760
is arranging a marriage
with Marquis Yongchang's family.

37:58.559 --> 38:01.240
If we apologize
and call off the marriage,

38:02.239 --> 38:04.879
Xiuwan's reputation will be ruined.

38:05.679 --> 38:08.160
How is she supposed
to face the world after that?

38:10.920 --> 38:13.519
Then there is only one other way.

38:15.239 --> 38:18.720
The Lin family's Second Young Lady
suddenly falls gravely ill

38:20.760 --> 38:22.999
and dies unexpectedly
at midnight tonight.

38:23.000 --> 38:24.120
No!

38:24.159 --> 38:26.479
No!

38:26.480 --> 38:28.678
No!

38:28.679 --> 38:30.118
- Father!
- No!

38:30.119 --> 38:30.959
No!

38:30.960 --> 38:32.959
No, Shunhua! No!

38:32.960 --> 38:34.080
No!

38:35.840 --> 38:37.352
Xiuwan is young and naive.

38:37.416 --> 38:39.230
That's why she
fell into a villain's trap.

38:39.239 --> 38:41.879
Please show her mercy, Old Master!

38:43.960 --> 38:45.600
Madam Wang has lost all sense.

38:46.039 --> 38:47.720
Have you lost yours, too?

38:49.239 --> 38:51.120
Do you think that now Du Zheng is dead,

38:51.239 --> 38:52.999
you can hide the truth from everyone

38:53.000 --> 38:55.320
and pretend nothing ever happened?

38:55.920 --> 38:58.800
Du Cuique is still alive.

38:59.760 --> 39:02.720
And Marquis Yongchang
is presiding over her case.

39:03.840 --> 39:06.118
Do you think Du Cuique

39:06.119 --> 39:07.999
will help you cover up the truth?

39:17.880 --> 39:19.640
What's done cannot be undone.

39:20.760 --> 39:23.120
For the sake
of the Lin family's reputation,

39:23.639 --> 39:25.718
and so the other young ladies
of the Lin family

39:25.719 --> 39:27.600
can still make good marriages,

39:27.840 --> 39:28.919
you...

39:31.199 --> 39:32.640
must die.

39:44.519 --> 39:45.640
You...

39:48.320 --> 39:50.479
want to drive my Xiuwan to her death.

39:57.440 --> 39:58.600
You...

40:00.559 --> 40:02.879
want to drive my Xiuwan to her death?

40:14.239 --> 40:15.399
They want to

40:16.920 --> 40:19.039
drive my Xiuwan to her death.

40:24.519 --> 40:26.640
They want to drive
my Xiuwan to her death.

40:29.360 --> 40:30.680
Then I...

40:34.280 --> 40:36.479
Then I don't want to live either!

40:37.880 --> 40:38.999
Mother!

40:47.039 --> 40:48.120
Mother!

40:51.599 --> 40:52.839
Mother!

40:56.880 --> 40:58.039
Lingxiao.

41:02.679 --> 41:04.359
Your children are still young.

41:04.400 --> 41:06.680
You mustn't do anything foolish.

41:09.000 --> 41:11.999
They want to drive
my Xiuwan to her death.

41:12.039 --> 41:15.200
How can I go on living?

41:16.920 --> 41:19.559
How am I supposed to live?

41:24.960 --> 41:25.839
Grandfather.

41:26.920 --> 41:28.439
Xiuwan did make a mistake,

41:28.559 --> 41:29.959
but it doesn't warrant death.

41:29.992 --> 41:31.990
I was the one
who brought trouble into our home.

41:32.000 --> 41:33.320
That's where it all began.

41:34.639 --> 41:37.120
Please spare Xiuwan, Grandfather.

41:38.760 --> 41:40.359
If I spare her,

41:40.599 --> 41:42.839
who will spare the Lin family?

41:44.039 --> 41:47.080
The Lin family is already
at odds with the Zhao family.

41:47.119 --> 41:47.919
Must we

41:47.920 --> 41:50.479
make an enemy
of the Marquis's family as well?

41:51.416 --> 41:52.904
The matchmaker came today

41:52.920 --> 41:54.712
to convey messages
between the two families

41:54.776 --> 41:56.740
and ask whether
the young lady's family consented.

41:56.750 --> 41:58.640
The birth-date cards
haven't been exchanged yet.

41:59.159 --> 42:01.720
The Lin and Yuan families
are only discussing a marriage.

42:03.239 --> 42:04.359
Our Lin family

42:04.960 --> 42:06.640
doesn't have only one young lady.

42:09.880 --> 42:11.800
You mean Xiuru?

42:56.639 --> 42:59.640
I'm willing to take Xiuwan's place

42:59.880 --> 43:01.240
and marry into the Yuan family.

43:04.740 --> 43:07.780
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.280 --> 43:10.919
Next year is
the triennial provincial examination.

43:11.119 --> 43:13.559
Aren't you preparing
for the provincial examination?

43:14.159 --> 43:15.518
Mister Lu has trouble with his hand

43:15.519 --> 43:16.839
and finds it difficult to write,

43:16.880 --> 43:19.200
so he hired me
to transcribe lyrics and songs.

43:19.679 --> 43:22.999
That way, I can earn some money
to help support my family.

43:23.320 --> 43:25.479
Now I need to prepare
for the provincial examination,

43:25.480 --> 43:27.704
but I've been worried
I couldn't manage everything.

43:28.800 --> 43:30.919
Fortunately, Lanxiang is here.

43:31.320 --> 43:32.518
Once I hand everything

43:32.519 --> 43:33.800
over to Lanxiang,

43:34.519 --> 43:36.399
I can focus on preparing
for the examination.

43:38.679 --> 43:39.640
Lanxiang.

43:40.000 --> 43:41.200
No need to fuss.

43:41.256 --> 43:42.744
I just came to see how you're doing.

43:42.750 --> 43:44.160
I'll sit for a while and then leave.

43:59.421 --> 44:03.541
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:06.381 --> 44:10.901
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:12.181 --> 44:16.101
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:16.781 --> 44:19.541
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:20.261 --> 44:22.581
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:22.581 --> 44:25.661
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:27.181 --> 44:31.421
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:34.341 --> 44:38.501
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:40.301 --> 44:43.861
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:43.861 --> 44:47.421
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:48.221 --> 44:53.901
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:54.261 --> 44:58.581
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:58.941 --> 45:01.901
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:01.901 --> 45:05.661
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:05.661 --> 45:08.541
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:08.541 --> 45:12.621
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:12.621 --> 45:15.981
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:15.981 --> 45:19.741
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:19.741 --> 45:23.741
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:24.501 --> 45:28.661
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:28.661 --> 45:32.101
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:32.101 --> 45:35.741
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:35.741 --> 45:38.621
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:38.621 --> 45:42.701
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:42.701 --> 45:46.061
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:46.061 --> 45:49.701
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:49.701 --> 45:57.501
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
